law.text:
		Proof of financial responsibility when required under this chapter may be given by proof that:

A policy or policies of motor vehicle liability insurance have been obtained and are in full force;


A bond has been duly executed;


A deposit has been made of money or securities; or


A self-insurance certificate has been filed, all as provided in this chapter.
			Such proof shall be presented to the Department in a form prescribed by the Commissioner.
